00:54:07,824 --> 00:54:17,249
So in a place like Newton or Brookline, Cambridge, they're going to be doing administration related to the demolition delay ordinance as well.

641
00:54:18,313 --> 00:54:19,514
a long list of other kinds of things.

642
00:54:19,534 --> 00:54:23,136
So they might actually be doing the study report.

